  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence for Health - E4H</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme builds on earlier UK investments in Pakistan.  It will strengthen the ability of Pakistan&#x2019;s health system to recover from COVID-19 pandemic as well as building resilience for future pandemics.  It will strengthen evidence-based decision making in the health sector and support the implementation of Universal Health Coverage (UHC) and build climate resilient health systems including for vulnerable communities.  It will focus technical assistance on the provincial governments of Punjab and Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (KP), with support for the Federal government as well support flood recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
